.Dd November 19, 2026
.Dt CCS-ARCHIVE 1
.Os macOS
.Sh NAME
.Nm ccs-archive
.Nd manage the Chicago Code Camp 2012 archival oracle and static snapshots
.Sh SYNOPSIS
.Nm
.Op Fl h | Fl -help
.Ar command
.Sh DESCRIPTION
The
.Nm
utility inspects and controls the resurrected 2012 Chicago Code Camp
.Pq Code Camp Server , ccs
reference environment running via Colima and Docker Compose in the
.Pa ../ccs-2025-12
worktree, without disturbing the
.Cm main
branch.
.Sh COMMANDS
.Bl -tag -width "snapshot"
.It Cm status
Show git branch/tag anchors, Colima/Docker container state, and static archive paths.
.It Cm boot
Ensure Colima is running via
.Xr zsvc 1
and start the
.Pa ../ccs-2025-12
containers with
.Xr docker-compose 1 .
.It Cm down
Stop the
.Pa ../ccs-2025-12
containers cleanly.
.It Cm snapshot
Mirror
.Lk http://localhost:3000/
into
.Pa ../ccs-2012-static
using
.Xr wget 1 .
.El
.Sh ENVIRONMENT
.Bl -tag -width "CCS_ORACLE_DIR"
.It Ev CCS_ORACLE_DIR
Path to the
.Cm origin/2025-12
worktree. Defaults to
.Pa ../ccs-2025-12 .
.It Ev CCS_STATIC_DIR
Output directory for the static HTML mirror. Defaults to
.Pa ../ccs-2012-static .
.El
.Sh SEE ALSO
.Pa doc/retrospective-and-roadmap.md ,
.Pa README.md
